00:03:49.780 --> 00:03:51.540
but we're using it
to enforce the data

00:03:51.540 --> 00:03:56.590
integrity for our
application fingerprints.

00:03:56.590 --> 00:03:58.240
All right.

00:03:58.240 --> 00:04:00.790
In order to start driving
